# Keep the build context small and never ship secrets or build artifacts.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.expo
**/.turbo
.turbo
.git
.github
.agent
.claude

# Secrets
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Tests / coverage / local junk
**/coverage
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store

# Note: we keep packages/web and packages/mobile package.json so pnpm can
# satisfy --frozen-lockfile; their source/deps are never copied into the image.

# Docs and planning material
docs
help
*.md
!packages/api/README.md
